@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title Browse, Search and Select an Entry
hide footbox
autonumber
actor Contributor
participant "app : App" as App
participant "dataset\n<<module>>" as Dataset
participant "Local file I/O" as Files

activate Contributor
Contributor -> App : _refresh_browse_list()\n(search key release / Refresh)
activate App
note over App : Normalize query; clear tree and ID cache.
App -> Dataset : load_all()
activate Dataset
Dataset -> Files : Ensure storage; read UTF-8 CSV
activate Files
Files --> Dataset : Row dictionaries
deactivate Files
Dataset --> App : Entries
deactivate Dataset
loop Each loaded row
  alt Query empty or substring matches text/category/contributor
    note over App : Cache row by ID and insert a visible tree row.
  else No match
    note over App : Skip row.
  end
end
App --> Contributor : Matching rows (possibly none)
deactivate App

opt Contributor selects a displayed row
  Contributor -> App : _on_browse_select(event)
  activate App
  note over App
    Resolve ID in the browse cache; populate editable fields.
    Retain selected ID and optional audio filename.
    Enable playback only when a filename is present.
    No additional CSV read is performed by this handler.
  end note
  App --> Contributor : Selected entry displayed
  deactivate App
end
deactivate Contributor
legend bottom
  An empty query lists all rows; filtering is case-insensitive.
  Selection without a cached row returns without changing the form.
  The load helper and widget calls are abstracted; file errors are not handled here.
endlegend
@enduml
